<p>Does this code have UB? To me it seems so, at least due to different types without explicit casting <code>int (*)[10] != int **</code>.</p>
<p>Also, what if I have <code>char b[] = &quot;some string&quot;;</code> instead? The behavior is almost the same... weird.</p>

