Title: Inconsistent delay time for executing code.
Body: <p>I'm trying to write some code to play animations with the help of the react package framer-motion:</p>
<pre><code>import React from &quot;react&quot;;
import './Line.css';
import { motion, useAnimation } from 'framer-motion';

