Title: Looping through an array and printing elements to the DOM.
Body: <p>I'm having trouble accessing an array, and looping through the array then printing the elements inside the array to the DOM. For some reason, it just print's only &quot;Relish&quot; and it doesn't print the two other elements inside the array &quot;Ketchup&quot; and &quot;Mustard&quot;. Is there anyway I can get a hint on how to accomplish this task?</p>
