Title: Raymarching Clamping coordinate makes weird streched artifacts.
Body: <p>I am trying to render a grid of spheres using ray marching. The SDF function looks like:</p>
<pre><code>float sq_layer(vec3 p, vec3 bounding_box_min, vec3 bounding_box_max)
{
         float cell_size = 4.0 / 16.0;
         vec3 p0 = clamp(p.xyz, bounding_box_min, bounding_box_max);
         p0 = mod(p0, cell_size) - cell_size * 0.5f;
         float d_pt = sphereSDF(vec3(p0.x, p0.y, p0.z), 0.05f)
         return d_pt;
}
</code></pre>
<p>But I am getting something like this:
<a href="https://i.stack.imgur.com/kYqLT.png" rel="nofollow noreferrer"><img src="https://i.stack.imgur.com/kYqLT.png" alt="enter image description here" /></a></p>
