</p>
<p>If you have the cursor on the media gallery and scroll down normally, you will first scroll horizontally through the gallery. That's on purpose. However, it stops when an iframe is included. I've already tried to prevent the pointer events during scrolling, but it leads to some other issues like making it impossible to click the play button of a video.</p>
