</code></pre>
<p>I want to retrieve or operate on all data with <code>-1</code> as the first entry of key tuple. Or in terms of the above example, all residents of <code>-1</code>.
I'm currently doing this, looping over all entries in Hashmap and manually checking the first part of key tuple.</p>
<pre><code>use std::collections::HashMap;

fn main(){
    let mut hmap: HashMap&lt;(i64,usize), &amp;str&gt; = HashMap::new();
    hmap.insert((-1,0), &quot;Oth -1 Resident&quot;);
