</code></pre>
<p>I tried the following things but it didn't work:</p>
<pre><code>SET mapred.max.split.size=1000000;
SET hive.exec.reducers.bytes.per.reducer=1000000;
SET hive.merge.size.per.task=1000000;
SET hive.merge.smallfiles.avgsize=1000000;
SET hive.exec.compress.output=true;
</code></pre>
<p>Please tell me what needs to be done for the same. Any help is appreciated.</p>

