Title: SwiftUI widget is not reloaded despite calling reloadAllTimelines.
Body: <p>I have a widget that shows me core data stuff data I modify in the app. All I want the widget to do is to refresh whenever the core data database in the main app refreshes.</p>
<p>Here is my widget</p>
<pre class="lang-swift prettyprint-override"><code>//
