Title: Update user password with LDAP when the user has the flag &#39;User must change password at next logon&#39; set, leads to error 49, subcode 773.
Body: <p>When I try to change the password of a user via LDAP, in whose AD account the setting is set that the password must be changed at the next login, I get the following error:</p>
