Title: Why can I still access array automatic allocated in function after return?.
Body: <p>I tried to run this simple code and was expecting it to crash:</p>
<pre><code>#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;

void setPtrOnTempData(char **ptr) {
    char str[] = &quot;AAAA&quot;;
    *ptr = str;
}

int main() {
