<p>UPD_1: I'm sorry for my inaccuracy, there was &quot;statically&quot; instead of &quot;automatic&quot; in the title at first.</p>
<p>UPD_2: I also tried to fill stack with some new data, for example, allocate in another function new array for 10 char elements, and call this function, thought maybe it will refresh data under <code>ptr</code> address, that was used by <code>setPtrOnTempData</code> earlier, but result is the same, data under <code>ptr</code> is not changed after it. Why is that so, if stack has grown and have been refreshed?</p>

