Title: I&#39;m not quite sure which side is the cause that my android app can&#39;t receive a UDP &quot;message&quot; from a Golang server.
Body: <p>I'm currently developing a server and app that needs to communicate using UDP. My server uses Golang, it's related code looks like this:</p>
<pre><code>import (
