&quot;blob:http:// localhost:8081/ed893b3d-298f-40c4-b4c0-1c3ac688aa43&quot;}</p>
</blockquote>
<p>The space in http:// localhost is for removing the hyperlink here.
For display the video and to play it I have this :</p>
<pre><code>{tempUrls.map(video =&gt;
        &lt;div key={video.name} style={{ flex: 2, padding: &quot;15px 20px&quot; }}&gt;
          &lt;video
