<p>Only the control placeholder is displayed but I can't play the video. Also, when I open the web page in Firefox this is displayed. &quot;No video with supported format and MIME type found&quot;. But I am not clear where exactly I made the mistake when converting. Actually I converted the array buffer to a blob of type mp4/video and then to a URL. Then saved it as object {filename, url} in a usestate and from this usestate the videos should be played/displayed.</p>
