<p>What I want is very simple: the only useful information for me is those that type is <code>warmEmissionEvent</code>, and I want to have a data frame which shows each line the time, linkID, CO and CO2Total value.</p>
<p>The problem is that this will be a very large XML file (20GB), so my laptop will die with the code below:</p>
