Title: jq to recursively profile JSON object.
Body: <p>I have some huge JSON files I need to profile so I can transform them into some tables. I found <code>jq</code> to be really useful in inspecting them, but there are going to be hundreds of these, and I'm pretty new to <code>jq</code>.</p>
