Title: Remix: Returned error: {&quot;jsonrpc&quot;:&quot;2.0&quot;,&quot;error&quot;:&quot;invalid opcode: PUSH0&quot;, &quot;id&quot;:2405507186007008}.
Body: <p>After runing my private chain node in geth and Chainlink node in my Ubuntu, I would like to test the function of Chainlink Any API(<a href="https://docs.chain.link/any-api/get-request/examples/single-word-response" rel="noreferrer">https://docs.chain.link/any-api/get-request/examples/single-word-response</a>, Single Word Response).</p>
<p>I ran these commands to run nodes:</p>
<pre><code>## SHELL1
cd ~/myChain/localChain/node1 &amp;&amp; geth --datadir data --gcmode &quot;archive&quot; --syncmode=full --networkid 4190 --http --http.addr 0.0.0.0 --http.port 6789 --http.corsdomain &quot;*&quot; --ws --port 30305 --allow-insecure-unlock --unlock edd96278959aA8B27DdC14FD70ACb31f7e7beC2F --keystore ./keystore console

