<li>Invoke the smart contract function <code>transfer</code> where the Hedera account is the caller and the transfer amount is 2.</li>
<li>This call succeeds.</li>
<li>Invoke the smart contract function <code>transfer</code> where the Hedera account is the caller and the transfer amount is 2.</li>
<li>This call does not succeed: Contract Revert with <code>SPENDER_DOES_NOT_HAVE_ALLOWANCE</code>.</li>
</ol>
<p>Smart Contract:</p>
<pre><code>// SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
