Title: How can I extract all the text visible to a user of a particular website in Dart?.
Body: <p>I am making an application in flutter for mobile devices (Android and iOS) and I would like to write a function in Dart that given a website returns all and only the strings that are visible to a user browsing it from a browser.</p>
