</code></pre>
<p>I would like to change the lines that only have the DOB <code>&quot;12-3-1998&quot;</code> to have the DOB <code>&quot;14-11-2001&quot; </code>and keep the others unchanged but I am struggling to find out how to do this without changing them all or changing none.</p>
